  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems in four files. I did not run the test suite, since the task was an edit-only change.\n\n- **Non-subscribers getting digests:** `listDigestSubscribers` in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts` now filters on `digestOnly = true` within the org. Before, any preference row in the workspace counted.\n- **Oldest updates kept:** `listUnreadSince` in `src/server/repositories/notification-repository.ts` now orders newest first (`createdAt` desc, then `id` desc). The existing cap then keeps the most recent entries, and the headline (`entries[0]`) is the newest. I removed the now-unused `asc` import.\n- **Archived workspaces sending digests:** `runDigestEmailJob` in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` now skips any org where `isLive(org)` is false, using the existing helper from `@/lib/soft-delete`.",
